      "text": "The driver never reached the pickup point. His own trace of 34 fixes shows a nearest approach of 219.77 m and a farthest of 219.77 m — he is stationary roughly 220 m away for the whole trace — so the number of fixes inside the 120 m LARGE_VENUE arrival radius is zero (qualifying_fix_count 0, longest qualifying run 0.0 s). Under POL-NS-02 the driver is not deemed to have ARRIVED at the Tower B pin, POL-NS-01 limb (b) fails, and the cancellation fee is not chargeable under POL-NS-01.",
