      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-02", "POL-NS-01"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.qualifying_fix_count"
    },
    {
      "text": "This is a wrong-entrance arrival, the situation POL-NS-03 governs. The trace shows the driver stationary at 219.77 m from the pickup pin — outside the 120 m arrival radius but inside the 400 m ceiling — continuously from 13:05:00 to 13:10:30, i.e. for 330 seconds, longer than the 300 second dwell required for this zone class. The driver did not arrive at the pickup point and the cancellation fee is refunded to the rider in full.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-09105", "EV-TRIP-09105"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"],
      "relies_on": "derived.driver_track.min_distance_m"
    },
    {
      "text": "The mislocation is the driver's, under POL-NS-03(i). The chat log shows the rider naming the sub-location at 13:05:05 — 'I am at Tower B ride-hail pickup, beside the blue sign.' — and again at 13:06:35: 'That is the other entrance. Please come to Tower B.' The driver answered at 13:06:00 only that he was 'waiting at the mall taxi stand', and his own filed statement concedes he 'did not move to Tower B'. A driver told the correct tower who does not move to it before cancelling bears the loss and receives no compensation.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-CHAT-09105", "EV-TRIP-09105"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-03"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Independently of the wrong-entrance analysis, the effective in-geofence dwell is zero seconds: run_count 0 and longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec 0.0 against the 300 second minimum for LARGE_VENUE — a shortfall of 300 seconds. Under POL-NS-06 the cancellation fee is not chargeable and is refunded to the rider in full, whether or not the rider was present and whether or not the rider responded to messages.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-09105", "EV-TRIP-09105"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.longest_qualifying_run.duration_sec"
    },
    {
      "text": "Nothing on this record excuses the zero dwell. EV-ADVIS-09105-01 is MISSING, carries no payload and weighs 0.0, so no traffic advisory covers this pickup road. POL-NS-06 limb (i) requires a present and populated advisory of type KERB_RESTRICTION, ENFORCEMENT, CLOSURE or ACCIDENT before in-geofence intervals may be summed or a hold excused; on a MISSING advisory limb (i) is simply unavailable and the full refund stands.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-ADVIS-09105-01"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06"],
      "relies_on": "derived.arrival.limb.unavailable",
      "asserted_weight": 0.0
    },
    {
      "text": "The rider was present at the pin and actively coordinating, which removes the premise of a rider no-show. Her track carries 16 qualifying fixes, all about 25 m from the pickup pin, across 13:05:30 to 13:10:30 — far inside the 150 m rider-presence radius for LARGE_VENUE. Her 13:06:35 message asked the driver to come to Tower B; the driver posted no reply to that locating instruction within 120 seconds and made no in-app call (trip_record.in_app_calls is empty) before terminating at 13:10:30, so POL-NS-04 refunds the fee in full with no driver compensation. The driver's only chat reply, at 13:06:00, answered nothing about the correct entrance and preceded the instruction to move.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-GPS-09105", "EV-CHAT-09105", "EV-TRIP-09105"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-04"],
      "relies_on": "derived.rider_presence.max_distance_m"
