      "text": "The sum to return is the cancellation-fee line only. The fare breakdown shows cancellation_fee SGD 4.00 against total_charged SGD 4.00, with payment_status CHARGED and refund_issued_sgd 0.00; SGD 4.00 is also the greater of the LARGE_VENUE zone-class fee (SGD 4.00) and the RYDE_X vehicle-tier fee (SGD 4.00), so there is no POL-NS-08(d) fare defect and SGD 4.00 is the amount refundable to the rider.",
      "evidence_ids": ["EV-FARE-09105"],
      "clause_ids": ["POL-NS-06", "POL-NS-03"]
    }
  ]
